alt="" loading="lazy"></div></div></section><section class="section faq-section"><div class="wrap faq-layout"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Rumman</p><h2>Clarity is part of the product.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Is Rumman an ERP?</summary><p>Yes. It is a guided ERP for micro and small businesses, bringing together customers, finance, operations, inventory, purchasing, documents and operational assistance.</p></details><details><summary>Does everything stay in the cloud?</summary><p>No. Detailed data stays primarily on the device. Rumman cloud services are limited to account, protection, summary, diagnostics, subscription and requested AI. Separately, when device backup is enabled, Android may store the operational database in the user’s private Google Account backup area.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if I lose or replace my phone?</summary><p>With device backup enabled, Android may restore the Rumman operational database using the same Google Account. Android controls this feature, which has a total limit of 25 MB per app and usually runs once a day when system conditions are met. Credentials, tokens, cache, scanned images and attachments are excluded.</p></details><details><summary>Does Rumman sell my data or show ads?</summary><p>No. Rumman does not sell data and does not show ads.</p></details><details><summary>Does AI make financial decisions by itself?</summary><p>No. It is designed to organize and guide. Important operations remain under the user confirmation and control.</p></details><details><summary>Is it already available on Google Play?</summary><p>There is no public listing yet. The product is being prepared for closed testing.</p></details><details><summary>Does Rumman manage inventory?</summary><p>Yes. The workflow records inbound and outbound movements, separates physical, reserved and available stock, and guides replenishment.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="final-cta"><div class="wrap final-cta-inner"><div><p class="eyebrow">Rumman · Guided Intelligent ERP</p><h2>Clearer management for work with less friction.</h2><p>Organize customers, cash flow, documents and everyday decisions in a guided Android experience.</p></div><a class="button primary" href="/en/features">Discover features</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-main"><div class="footer-brand-block"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="/en/"><span class="brand-icon"><img src="/assets/rumman-brand-mark-original.png" width="680" height="680" alt=""></span><span class="brand-name">Rumman</span></a><p>Guided intelligent Android ERP for small businesses.</p></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Product</strong><a href="/en/features">Features</a><a href="/en/how-it-works">How it works</a><a href="/en/plans">Plans</a><a href="/en/faq" aria-current="page">FAQ</a></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Content</strong><a href="/en/blog/">Blog</a><a href="/en/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/excluir-conta">Delete account</a><a href="mailto:e-mail@rumman.app.br">Support</a></div><div class="footer-links"><strong>Development</strong><a href="mailto:devs@pascoal.eti.br">Technical contact</a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 Rumman</span><nav class="language-switcher footer-language" aria-label="Language"><span class="visually-hidden">Language</span><a href="/faq" lang="pt-BR">PT</a><a href="/en/faq" lang="en" aria-current="page">EN</a><a href="/es/preguntas-frecuentes" lang="es">ES</a><a href="/fr/questions-frequentes" lang="fr">FR</a></nav><span>Built by <a href="https://pascoal.eti.br" rel="external noopener">pascoal.eti.br</a></span></div></footer><script src="/assets/site.js?v=20260722-6" defer></script></body></html>